  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/IMG_6103.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(48 fotos) Este domingo ha abierto sus puertas en la calle Salvador Barri, 10 de Onda la tienda El Sue&ntilde;o de Maggie, regentada por Mar&iacute;a Esteve, despu&eacute;s de varios meses de venta exclusiva en internet de ropa y complementos para mujer, con el mejor dise&ntilde;o y la mayor calidad.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6100.jpg\" alt=\"img_6100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6103.jpg\" alt=\"img_6103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6104.jpg\" alt=\"img_6104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6105.jpg\" alt=\"img_6105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6107.jpg\" alt=\"img_6107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6109.jpg\" alt=\"img_6109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6110.jpg\" alt=\"img_6110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6112.jpg\" alt=\"img_6112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugtiendaelsuenodemaggie/img_6113.jpg\" alt=\"img_6113\" style=\"max-width:100%;he